  sentences:
  - text: "Ils seront de retour d\xE8s demain. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Demain ? \xC7a veut dire qu\u2019on pourra les interroger"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a68b2376e53284bb4ce3103615c962, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "\u2026 Je crois que je me suis tromp\xE9. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Ah\u2026 D\u2019accord, surtout n'h\xE9site pas \xE0 relire tes notes
      au besoin. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
